"id": "p10_i7",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p10_i8",
"text": "RAW",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p10_i9",
"text": "原始資料：保留不動",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p10_i10",
"text": "像收到的包裹。即使裡面有髒資料，也不要直接覆蓋，方便之後重新檢查。",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p10_i11",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p10_i12",
