"id": "p11_i3",
"text": "B",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p11_i4",
"text": "把興趣改寫成可回答的問題",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p11_i5",
"text": "好問題要能指出對象、比較方式與指標，而且資料欄位真的存在。",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p11_i6",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p11_i7",
"text": "把每一步留下證據，下一步才有依據。",
"kind": "shape"
}
]
},
"p12": {
"index": 12,
"elements": [
{
"id": "p12_i19",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i2",
"text": "PYTHON 資料分析實戰",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i3",
"text": "『哪裡生意最好？』還不夠清楚",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i4",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i5",
"text": "12",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i6",
"text": "Lesson 19",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i7",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i8",
"text": "太模糊",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i9",
"text": "哪裡生意最好？",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i10",
"text": "『哪裡』是城市還是門市？『最好』是營業額、訂單數，還是顧客數？",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i11",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i12",
"text": "每個人可能算出不同答案",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i13",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i14",
"text": "可回答",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i15",
"text": "哪個城市的營業額最高？",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i16",
"text": "對象是 city，指標是 revenue，方法是 groupby + sum，再由大到小排序。",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i17",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p12_i18",
"text": "問題 → 欄位 → 指標 → 方法",
"kind": "shape"
}
]
},
"p13": {
"index": 13,
"elements": [
{
"id": "p13_i22",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i2",
"text": "PYTHON 資料分析實戰",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i3",
"text": "問題、欄位與方法要排成同一條線",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i4",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i5",
"text": "13",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i6",
"text": "Lesson 19",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i7",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i8",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i9",
"text": "問題 1",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i10",
"text": "哪個城市營業額最高？",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i11",
"text": "city + quantity + unit_price → 新增 revenue → groupby city → sum",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i12",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i13",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i14",
"text": "問題 2",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i15",
"text": "哪個分類平均訂單金額最高？",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i16",
"text": "category + revenue → groupby category → mean → sort_values",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i17",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i18",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i19",
"text": "問題 3",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i20",
"text": "七月與八月營業額如何變化？",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p13_i21",
"text": "order_date + revenue → 建立 month → groupby month → sum",
"kind": "shape"
}
]
},
