"elements": [
{
"id": "p15_i15",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p15_i2",
"text": "PYTHON 資料分析實戰",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p15_i3",
"text": "第一步只做一件事：把 CSV 讀進來",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p15_i4",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p15_i5",
"text": "15",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p15_i6",
"text": "Lesson 19",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p15_i7",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p15_i8",
"text": "PYTHON",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p15_i9",
"text": "from pathlib import Path\nimport pandas as pd\n\ndata_path = Path(\"lesson19_project_sales.csv\")\ndf = pd.read_csv(data_path)\n\nprint(df.head())\nprint(df.shape)",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p15_i10",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p15_i11",
"text": "先確認有讀到",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p15_i12",
"text": "1. Path 指向同資料夾 CSV\n\n2. read_csv 讀成 DataFrame\n\n3. head 看內容\n\n4. shape 看列數與欄數",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p15_i13",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p15_i14",
"text": "看到表格，才進下一步。",
"kind": "shape"
}
]
},
"p16": {
"index": 16,
"elements": [
{
"id": "p16_i15",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p16_i2",
"text": "PYTHON 資料分析實戰",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p16_i3",
"text": "資料健檢：像拆箱後先點貨",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p16_i4",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p16_i5",
"text": "16",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p16_i6",
"text": "Lesson 19",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p16_i7",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p16_i8",
"text": "PYTHON",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p16_i9",
"text": "print(df.shape)\nprint(df.columns.tolist())\nprint(df.dtypes)\n\nprint(df.isna().sum())\nprint(df.duplicated(\"order_id\").sum())",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p16_i10",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p16_i11",
"text": "五個基本問題",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p16_i12",
"text": "shape：規模\n\ncolumns：有哪些欄位\n\ndtypes：目前型態\n\nisna：缺漏在哪裡\n\nduplicated：是否重複",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p16_i13",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p16_i14",
"text": "健檢先於分析",
"kind": "shape"
}
]
},
"p17": {
"index": 17,
"elements": [
{
"id": "p17_i22",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i2",
"text": "PYTHON 資料分析實戰",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i3",
"text": "清理不是按一個按鈕，而是一連串決策",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i4",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i5",
"text": "17",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i6",
"text": "Lesson 19",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i7",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i8",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i9",
"text": "文字",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i10",
"text": "去空白、統一大小寫與分類",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i11",
"text": "strip、lower、replace；先看 value_counts，避免把不同意思錯合併。",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i12",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i13",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i14",
"text": "數字",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i15",
"text": "無效文字先轉成缺值",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i16",
"text": "pd.to_numeric(errors='coerce') 會把 two 變成 NaN，再決定保留或移除。",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i17",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i18",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i19",
"text": "日期",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i20",
"text": "轉成 datetime，無效日期要被看見",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p17_i21",
"text": "pd.to_datetime(errors='coerce') 讓錯誤日期變 NaT。",
"kind": "shape"
}
]
},
"p18": {
"index": 18,
"elements": [
{
"id": "p18_i13",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p18_i2",
"text": "PYTHON 資料分析實戰",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p18_i3",
"text": "把文字與分類先整理成一致的樣子",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p18_i4",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p18_i5",
"text": "18",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p18_i6",
"text": "Lesson 19",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p18_i7",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p18_i8",
"text": "PYTHON",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p18_i9",
"text": "clean_df = df.copy()\n\nfor column in [\"city\", \"category\", \"product\", \"payment\"]:\n    clean_df[column] = (\n        clean_df[column]\n        .astype(\"string\")\n        .str.strip()\n    )\n\nclean_df[\"payment\"] = clean_df[\"payment\"].str.lower()",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p18_i10",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p18_i11",
"text": "文字清理四步",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p18_i12",
"text": "copy 保留原始 df\n\nastype('string') 統一文字型態\n\nstrip 移除前後空白\n\nlower 統一英文大小寫",
"kind": "shape"
}
]
},
"p19": {
"index": 19,
"elements": [
{
"id": "p19_i15",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p19_i2",
"text": "PYTHON 資料分析實戰",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p19_i3",
"text": "數字與日期：轉換失敗要留下可檢查的記號",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p19_i4",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p19_i5",
"text": "19",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p19_i6",
"text": "Lesson 19",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p19_i7",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p19_i8",
"text": "PYTHON",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p19_i9",
"text": "clean_df[\"quantity\"] = pd.to_numeric(\n    clean_df[\"quantity\"], errors=\"coerce\"\n)\n\nclean_df[\"unit_price\"] = pd.to_numeric(\n    clean_df[\"unit_price\"], errors=\"coerce\"\n)\n\nclean_df[\"order_date\"] = pd.to_datetime(\n    clean_df[\"order_date\"], errors=\"coerce\"\n)",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p19_i10",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p19_i11",
"text": "先標記，再決策",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p19_i12",
"text": "coerce 的意思：\n無法轉換時不要中斷，先改成 NaN 或 NaT。\n\n接著用 isna 找出失敗列，再決定怎麼處理。",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p19_i13",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p19_i14",
"text": "NaN / NaT 是線索",
"kind": "shape"
}
]
},
"p20": {
"index": 20,
"elements": [
{
"id": "p20_i19",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i2",
"text": "PYTHON 資料分析實戰",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i3",
"text": "缺值與重複值：沒有永遠正確的單一答案",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i4",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i5",
"text": "20",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i6",
"text": "Lesson 19",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i7",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i8",
"text": "可以補值",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i9",
"text": "答案合理而且有依據",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i10",
"text": "例如付款方式缺漏，只做筆數統計時可以標成『未知』；但要清楚說明這是分類，不是原本答案。",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i11",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i12",
"text": "保留資料，但新增假設",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i13",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i14",
"text": "可以移除",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i15",
"text": "缺少的是計算必要欄位",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i16",
"text": "quantity 或 unit_price 缺漏時，這列無法可靠計算 revenue；本案例選擇移除。",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i17",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p20_i18",
"text": "少一筆，也比算錯好",
"kind": "shape"
}
]
},
"p21": {
"index": 21,
"elements": [
{
"id": "p21_i15",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p21_i2",
"text": "PYTHON 資料分析實戰",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p21_i3",
"text": "清理後才建立分析欄位 revenue",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p21_i4",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p21_i5",
"text": "21",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p21_i6",
"text": "Lesson 19",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p21_i7",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p21_i8",
"text": "PYTHON",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p21_i9",
"text": "clean_df = clean_df.drop_duplicates(\"order_id\")\n\nclean_df[\"city\"] = clean_df[\"city\"].fillna(\"未知\")\nclean_df[\"payment\"] = clean_df[\"payment\"].fillna(\"未知\")\n\nclean_df = clean_df.dropna(\n    subset=[\"order_date\", \"quantity\", \"unit_price\"]\n)\n\nclean_df[\"revenue\"] = (\n    clean_df[\"quantity\"] * clean_df[\"unit_price\"]\n)",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p21_i10",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p21_i11",
"text": "順序很重要",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p21_i12",
"text": "先去重複\n\n分類缺值標成未知\n\n必要欄位缺值移除\n\n最後才計算營業額",
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p21_i13",
"text": null,
"kind": "shape"
},
{
"id": "p21_i14",
"text": "49 列 → 45 列",
